            "value": "1 x M.2 connector (Socket 3, M key, type 2242/2260/2280/22110 SATA and PCIe x4*/x2 SSD support) * Actual support may vary by CPU. 1 x U.2 connector * When the U.2 connector is populated, the M.2 connector becomes unavailable. 2 x SATA Express connectors 8 x SATA 6Gb/s connectors Support for RAID 0, RAID 1, and RAID 10 * Refer to \"1-8 Internal Connectors,\" for the installation notices for the M.2 and SATA connectors."
